      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Transcription Provider**\n\nOkay, I've decided to use Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API for the transcription service. I'm focusing on incorporating the specific API calls within the `submit_transcription.py` script. The goal is to make the external service calls clear and maintainable within the file.\n\n\n**Selecting Speech-to-Text API**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on integrating the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API. The `submit_transcription.py` script will be the key focus, particularly embedding the external calls within it. Specifically, I plan to leverage the `google-cloud-speech` library to streamline the external service interactions and ensure clarity.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820586158,
          "start": 1789820583639
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b99ebed7001B5F3g5wGlP2SiW",
